    k4c_chk_list (by decide +kernel)
  intro q hq
  simp only [StairTerminalV3.reverseRecord, wires_append, Finset.mem_union] at hq
  rcases hq with hc | ht | hu
  · exact cl q hc
  · exact tk q ht
