/-!
# Outer lift of the slot bound (field 11)

`outerProgram E X` is the concrete outer wrapper of `StairConcreteAssembly`
with its two arithmetic rests as parameters; `outerProgram_slots_le` lifts
bounds on the rests to the exact `StairOpen.slot_composition` shape, and
`slot_composition_of_rests` combines it with `entryRestOf_slots_le` /
`exitRestOf_slots_le`.
